<title>POLAND: GPRD JULY NET RISES TO PLN 3.1 MLN.</title>
<headline>GPRD JULY NET RISES TO PLN 3.1 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results July</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> JULY		     1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     3.13 vs   1.21</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 3.31 vs   1.72</p>
<p> Operating profit     3.07 vs   1.89</p>
<p> Sales		   20.38 vs  16.25</p>
<p> JANUARY-JULY	   1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.90 vs   3.15</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 2.07 vs   4.64</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.37 vs   4.91</p>
<p> Sales		   70.63 vs  53.16</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish construction company is Gdanskie</p>
<p>Przedsiebiorstwo Robot Drogowych SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
